sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant A as Agent
  participant G as Sentinel Guard
  participant N as Webhook (Slack)
  participant Al as Alice
  participant B as Bob
  A->>G: propose close-account (policy approvals: 2)
  G-->>A: pending (requiredApprovals 2)
  G->>N: needs 2 different people · link to the inbox
  Al->>G: approve (her OIDC or personal token)
  G->>G: approval-added, signed · still Pending
  G->>N: approved by alice, needs 1 more
  Al->>G: approve again
  G-->>Al: 403 already approved
  B->>G: approve
  G->>G: approved, signed · Approved
  A->>G: status
  G-->>A: capability (approvers: alice, bob)
  A->>G: spend once, then act
